#X text 560 260 [rec-file PREFIX] - records the two signal inlets to ~/Music/Recordings/PREFIX/PREFIX-NNN.wav (24-bit) \, found as ../../../../Music from this file (the repo lives in ~/Documents/Pd). right inlet: 1 = start a new file (the first free number) \, 0 = stop \, folder PATH = write into PATH instead (numbering starts again there) \, prefix NAME = name files NAME-01.wav \, NAME-02.wav... from now on. outlet: the path of each new file., f 40;
